ment.\"<|>\"approved settlement methodology\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"市场合同电量\"<|>\"Generation enterprises' market contract volumes determine settlement prices for electricity beyond priority/base generation.\"<|>\"contract volume pricing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"下调电量补偿单价\"<|>\"偏差考核费用\"<|>\"Down-adjustment compensation unit price directly determines deviation penalty fees for under-consumption beyond threshold limits.\"<|>\"penalty fee calculation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"风电\"<|>\"可再生能源\"<|>\"Wind power is explicitly categorized and settled as a form of renewable energy under regulatory provisions.\"<|>\"energy type classification\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"光伏\"<|>\"可再生能源\"<|>\"Photovoltaic power is explicitly categorized and settled as a form of renewable energy under regulatory provisions.\"<|>\"energy type classification\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"无调节能力的水电\"<|>\"可再生能源\"<|>\"Hydropower without regulation capability is explicitly categorized and settled as renewable energy under regulatory provisions.\"<|>\"energy type classification\"<|>10)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity settlement regulations, deviation management, renewable integration, contract compliance, grid operations\")<|COMPLETE|>"
